        "prompt": "define",
        "text": "=Generate 3 product descriptions to represent \"{{ $json.product_name }}\" taking into account {{ $json.brand_name }}  profile, to people like {{ $json.buyer_person_name }}. Use these instructions:\n\n1. These are the \"{{ $json.product_name }}\" details:\nProduct_Details_list\n\n2. These are the competitive advantages of \"{{ $json.product_name }}\" details:\nCompetitive_Advantages_list\n\n3. These are the  details of Buyer Person selected:\n{{ $json.buyer_person_selected_details }}\n\n4. Generate 3 product variants that matches the Buyer Person selected details in a .json file,  The output is a correct formed JSON array that contains the generated elements, each one of then must replicate this structure:\n\n{\n  \"Product\": {\n    \"Name\": \"Plata Plus\",\n    \"Type\": \"Product 1\",\n    \"Details\": {\n      \"Core_Characteristic\": \"A versatile credit card with high credit limits and minimal fees, perfect for frequent shoppers.\",\n      \"Competitive_Advantage\": \"Offers up to 2 months without interest on all purchases, allowing for easy budget management.\",\n      \"Description\": \"Plata Plus caters to those who need flexibility in spending with benefits like increased credit limits and simple fee structures.\",\n      \"Benefit_Related_to_Hypothesis\": \"Attracts high-spending individuals by reducing financial stress, thus improving user retention.\",\n      \"Product_Details\": {\n        \"Features\": [\n          \"No Annual Fees.\",\n          \"Up to 15% Cashback.\",\n          \"Interest-Free Installments\"\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nPlease, omit any introductory comment previously to the answer, go directly to the output, and remove from response json tag.",
        "options": {}
